This product bundles aria2 (https://aria2.github.io/), a separate program that is
run as an external executable and controlled over JSON-RPC. Its source code is not
linked into or modified by Mido Download.

  aria2 1.37.0 — Copyright (C) 2006, 2019 Tatsuhiro Tsujikawa
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
  The full license text is included as resources/aria2/COPYING.
  Source code: https://github.com/aria2/aria2/releases/tag/release-1.37.0

It also bundles two separate programs for video sites (YouTube, Facebook, Instagram…),
run as external executables (their code is not linked into Mido Download):

  yt-dlp — https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
  Released into the public domain under the Unlicense. The app keeps it updated from the
  official GitHub releases (checked against the published SHA-256 sums).

  FFmpeg 8.1 (LGPL "shared" build by BtbN, https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds)
  Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.
  The license text is included as resources/ffmpeg/LICENSE.txt.
  Source code: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html (release 8.1) and the build scripts at
  https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds

Downloading from video sites may be restricted by their terms of service and by copyright.
Only download videos you are allowed to (for example your own, or openly licensed ones).
